================================================================================
1. Third-party code
================================================================================

    None is redistributed. The watcher uses the Python standard library only,
    and tests/test_provenance.py holds it to that -- a tower that needs a
    dependency update is a tower that eventually stops watching.

================================================================================
2. Observed material  --  state.json, WATCH.md, feed.xml
================================================================================

    The tower records what moved at the sources listed in sources.json: the
    title and the link of a release, an issue, a pull request or a template,
    and a digest of a page it watches for change. Those titles belong to
    whoever published them and are reproduced only to identify the item and
    point at it. No page content, release asset or issue text is copied here;
    follow the link for the material itself and the terms it carries.

